  "cue_count": 70,
  "cues": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.5,
      "text": "Sea level rise will be one of the greatest challenges we face in the next century.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160426,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.079041
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start": 5.5,
      "end": 10.92,
      "text": "How high seas rise and how soon has a lot to do with what happens here.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160426,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.079041
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start": 10.92,
      "end": 13.6,
      "text": "Antarctica holds the largest chunk of ice on Earth.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160426,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.079041
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start": 13.6,
      "end": 17.04,
      "text": "Its western portion alone contains enough ice to raise sea levels by more than three",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160426,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.079041
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start": 17.04,
      "end": 18.04,
      "text": "meters.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160426,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.079041
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start": 18.04,
      "end": 25.03,
      "text": "And it's in big trouble, largely because of this, the Thwaites Glacier.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160426,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.079041
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start": 25.03,
      "end": 30.15,
      "text": "Its face towers as high as a six-story building, and extends for 120 kilometers across the",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160426,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.079041
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start": 30.15,
      "end": 34.71,
      "text": "coast of West Antarctica, making it about the size of Florida.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.192753,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003376
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start": 34.71,
      "end": 38.95,
      "text": "It's a humongous glacier that reaches right into the heart of West Antarctica.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.192753,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003376
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start": 38.95,
      "end": 42.95,
      "text": "And that's a major problem, because in the past couple decades it's become increasingly",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.192753,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003376
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start": 42.95,
      "end": 56.55,
      "text": "clear the Thwaites Glacier is falling apart.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.192753,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003376
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start": 56.55,
      "end": 61.35,
      "text": "These are portraits of a vast, rugged, treacherous continent, which has challenged man since",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.192753,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003376
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start": 61.35,
      "end": 67.27,
      "text": "first he could sail beyond the limits of his horizon, Antarctica.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.192753,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003376
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start": 67.27,
      "end": 68.95,
      "text": "This is the Antarctic Ice Sheet.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.192753,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.003376
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start": 68.95,
      "end": 73.59,
      "text": "It's thickest in the middle, where years and years of snowfall compacts into ice.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117251,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007118
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start": 73.59,
      "end": 78.05,
      "text": "As the middle builds, it pushes ice out towards the oceans via glaciers.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117251,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007118
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start": 78.05,
      "end": 81.39,
      "text": "And the part of a glacier that floats on water is its ice shelf.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117251,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007118
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start": 81.39,
      "end": 86.07,
      "text": "Today, man-made climate change is warming the air and water around Antarctica, causing",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117251,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007118
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start": 86.07,
      "end": 89.95,
      "text": "each side of the ice sheet to melt, but at very different speeds.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117251,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007118
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start": 89.95,
      "end": 94.39,
      "text": "The eastern ice sheet lies mostly on high ground, above sea level, which keeps it relatively",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117251,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007118
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start": 94.39,
      "end": 96.85,
      "text": "safe from warm ocean water.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.117251,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.007118
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start": 96.85,
      "end": 100.29,
      "text": "That means it's melting slowly and remains relatively stable.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152734,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000144
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start": 100.29,
      "end": 102.97,
      "text": "But West Antarctica is different.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152734,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000144
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start": 102.97,
      "end": 105.41,
      "text": "Most of it lies below sea level.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152734,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000144
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start": 105.41,
      "end": 111.29,
      "text": "That means as it thins, water can undermine it, possibly kickstarting a more rapid collapse.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152734,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000144
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start": 111.29,
      "end": 114.73,
      "text": "It's why West Antarctica is considered the most important piece of ice in the world when",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152734,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000144
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start": 114.73,
      "end": 116.13,
      "text": "it comes to climate change.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152734,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000144
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start": 116.13,
      "end": 120.85,
      "text": "Here's another view of the bedrock underneath Antarctica's ice sheet.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152734,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000144
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start": 120.85,
      "end": 125.81,
      "text": "The green, yellow, and red parts are land above sea level, like in eastern Antarctica.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.152734,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.000144
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start": 125.81,
      "end": 130.01,
      "text": "But these blue areas in western Antarctica are all below sea level.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160244,
      "no_speech_prob": 3.9e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start": 130.01,
      "end": 134.57,
      "text": "This area, where the bedrock slopes continuously for more than a mile down and deep into the",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160244,
      "no_speech_prob": 3.9e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start": 134.57,
      "end": 137.69,
      "text": "center of Antarctica, is the Thwaite's Glacier.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160244,
      "no_speech_prob": 3.9e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start": 137.69,
      "end": 142.04,
      "text": "And it could be the most dangerous glacier in the world.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160244,
      "no_speech_prob": 3.9e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start": 142.04,
      "end": 147.12,
      "text": "Surrounded by three mighty oceans, the seas are as much a part of Antarctica as their",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160244,
      "no_speech_prob": 3.9e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start": 147.12,
      "end": 149.8,
      "text": "highest mountain.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160244,
      "no_speech_prob": 3.9e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start": 149.8,
      "end": 152.04,
      "text": "Right now, Thwaite's is barely hanging on.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160244,
      "no_speech_prob": 3.9e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start": 152.04,
      "end": 156.96,
      "text": "In the past 30 years, the front of Thwaite's ice shelf has lost a lot of ice, causing it",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.160244,
      "no_speech_prob": 3.9e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "start": 156.96,
      "end": 158.68,
      "text": "to retreat backwards.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109872,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00057
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "start": 158.68,
      "end": 163.56,
      "text": "With a smaller ice shelf to slow the flow of ice, the flow of the glacier speeds up.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109872,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00057
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "start": 163.56,
      "end": 167.92,
      "text": "But the bigger problem is the glacier's grounding line, the final point where the glacier rests",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109872,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00057
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "start": 167.92,
      "end": 169.68,
      "text": "on the bedrock.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109872,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00057
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "start": 169.68,
      "end": 173.48,
      "text": "That grounding line has been shifting backwards as warm ocean water reaches underneath the",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109872,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00057
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "start": 173.48,
      "end": 174.48,
      "text": "ice shelf.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109872,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00057
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "start": 174.48,
      "end": 178.52,
      "text": "It's moved 14 kilometers since 1992.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109872,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00057
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "start": 178.52,
      "end": 184.52,
      "text": "So ice that used to be on land becomes ice that is floating on water, raising sea levels.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.109872,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00057
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "start": 184.52,
      "end": 188.4,
      "text": "The downhill slope of the bedrock means that as the grounding line moves back, it lifts",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115711,
      "no_speech_prob": 5.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "start": 188.4,
      "end": 193.48,
      "text": "an even bigger slice of ice behind it off the land and into the water, and that accelerates",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115711,
      "no_speech_prob": 5.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "start": 193.48,
      "end": 196.08,
      "text": "the flow of the glacier into the sea.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115711,
      "no_speech_prob": 5.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "start": 196.08,
      "end": 199.92,
      "text": "The amount of ice flowing from Thwaite's has doubled over the past 30 years, and already",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115711,
      "no_speech_prob": 5.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "start": 199.92,
      "end": 203.96,
      "text": "contributes 4% to global sea level rise.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115711,
      "no_speech_prob": 5.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "start": 203.96,
      "end": 208.56,
      "text": "And scientists have recently detected a huge cavity, two-thirds the size of Manhattan,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115711,
      "no_speech_prob": 5.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "start": 208.56,
      "end": 210.28,
      "text": "down here.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115711,
      "no_speech_prob": 5.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "start": 210.28,
      "end": 213.6,
      "text": "Scientists believe this could mean Thwaite's collapse is inevitable.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.115711,
      "no_speech_prob": 5.7e-05
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "start": 213.6,
      "end": 219.7,
      "text": "How soon that happens is hotly debated.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157266,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "start": 219.7,
      "end": 225.38,
      "text": "Being continent is awakening, slowly at first, but with ever-gathering momentum.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157266,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "start": 225.38,
      "end": 229.18,
      "text": "The complete collapse of Thwaite's will take centuries, and it's affected by many different",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157266,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "start": 229.18,
      "end": 232.98,
      "text": "things, from the temperature of the ocean currents to the makeup of the bedrock.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157266,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "start": 232.98,
      "end": 237.06,
      "text": "But research shows that humans can possibly slow or even stall its collapse by curbing",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157266,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "start": 237.06,
      "end": 239.1,
      "text": "greenhouse gas emissions soon.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157266,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "start": 239.1,
      "end": 243.22,
      "text": "That's important because some scientists believe collapse could start this century,",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157266,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "start": 243.22,
      "end": 246.02,
      "text": "while others say it's already underway.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.157266,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.012428
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "start": 246.02,
      "end": 250.22,
      "text": "The collapse of Thwaite's would add about half a meter of sea level rise, and trigger",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131836,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00083
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "start": 250.22,
      "end": 252.78,
      "text": "a much bigger catastrophe.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131836,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00083
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "start": 252.78,
      "end": 255.94,
      "text": "Because Thwaite's reaches into the middle of western Antarctica, its collapse could",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131836,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00083
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "start": 255.94,
      "end": 260.58,
      "text": "cause the rest of the ice sheet to collapse with it, resulting in more than three meters",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131836,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00083
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "start": 260.58,
      "end": 263.22,
      "text": "of sea level rise in the next few centuries.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131836,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00083
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "start": 263.22,
      "end": 267.54,
      "text": "That would submerge not only Miami and southern Bangladesh, but also parts of the Netherlands",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131836,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00083
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "start": 267.54,
      "end": 269.34,
      "text": "and New York City.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131836,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00083
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "start": 269.34,
      "end": 273.5,
      "text": "So while there's a lot of uncertainty around Thwaite's, one thing is clear.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.131836,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.00083
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "start": 273.5,
      "end": 275.82,
      "text": "Because it starts to collapse, it won't stop.",
      "source": "faster_whisper_small",
      "avg_logprob": -0.438337,
      "no_speech_prob": 0.945312
    }
  ],
  "created_at": "2026-11-12T19:14:27+0800"
}
